# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong triggers on a surveil made by another permanent's triggered ability, and "do this only
# once each turn" (CR 603.2h). Bot1 puts the Planetarium out on turn 1 with Sol Ring, Black Lotus and Mox Jet, then plays
# Meticulous Archive: its enters trigger surveils 1 and keeps Misshapen Fiend on top. The surveil triggers the
# Planetarium (CR 701.25d): Bot1 looks at the Fiend and casts it without paying its mana cost. Then Bot1 activates the
# Planetarium with Mox Pearl and scries 2, keeping Ornithopter on top: having cast a card with it this turn, the ability
# does not trigger at all (the ruling), so nothing goes on the stack after the scry and Ornithopter stays on top of the
# library, never looked at.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong
Meticulous Archive
Mox Pearl
Misshapen Fiend
Ornithopter
Island
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

